# Django REST Framework Backend

## Stack
- Python 3.12+.
- Django 5+.
- Django REST Framework.
- PostgreSQL Neon.
- JWT.
- CORS seguro.
- Variables de entorno.
- Services + selectors + serializers + permissions.

